{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/868386-supernatural-cover","id":868386,"title":"Supernatural Cover","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-04-19T06:46:50-07:00","id":868386,"title":"Supernatural Cover","content":"So if I understand it correctly, a demon can soul pact a vampire and take their form as a cover, but gains none of their supernatural benefits.<br /> <br /> To supernatural senses would they show up as a kindred? Like if someone used auspex would they just seem like a kindred or would they have to roll cover to spoof it?<br /> <br /> Also how could a demon imitate other supernatural?<br /> <br /> I was thinking of a new incarnation like Infiltrator or something to that effect. I could see the God machine attempting to insert angels into groups to gather information and for ease of manipulation. <br /> <br /> So how you'd you make a demon that could impersonate a vampire?<br /> <br /> I was thinking the social dynamic embed would be a good idea","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1117-overload","name":"overload","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1117_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-19T07:18:43-07:00","id":868401,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>overload</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/868386-supernatural-cover#post868386\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So if I understand it correctly, a demon can soul pact a vampire and take their form as a cover, but gains none of their supernatural benefits.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, they only get &quot;Vampire as if they were human&quot;.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>overload</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/868386-supernatural-cover#post868386\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To supernatural senses would they show up as a kindred? Like if someone used auspex would they just seem like a kindred or would they have to roll cover to spoof it?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think they still need Deep Cover to Spoof as non-human. And against Auspex, would provoke Clash of Wills. Not sure if they'd trigger the Predator's Taint.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>overload</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/868386-supernatural-cover#post868386\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also how could a demon imitate other supernatural?</div> </div> </div> </div>Deep Cover and Show of Power. Deep Cover lets them detect as X, Show of Power lets them mimic X's powers (albeit capped at 1 success, or 3 on a Ex!Success).<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>overload</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/868386-supernatural-cover#post868386\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was thinking of a new incarnation like Infiltrator or something to that effect. I could see the God machine attempting to insert angels into groups to gather information and for ease of manipulation.</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe? I think Messenger covers it, if need be. Generally speaking, I get the feeling that the G-M doesn't like playing with other supernaturals much, though.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>overload</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/868386-supernatural-cover#post868386\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So how you'd you make a demon that could impersonate a vampire?</div> </div> </div> </div>Soul Pacted a Vampire (neonate to reduce Ag!Damage on claiming) for the place in their society, Tattooed Deep Cover Gadget, mix of Show of Power Gadgets (worn, or subsumed), and a <i>lot</i> of BS. Honestly, you could just re-purpose any of your Covers, if need be, as long as you are diligent with that Deep Cover.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>overload</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/868386-supernatural-cover#post868386\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was thinking the social dynamic embed would be a good idea</div> </div> </div> </div>Social Embeds and Exploits are Hell on Wheels for Demons when interacting with Kindred. Since so much of Vampire is tied up with social structures, you can play around with them like Legos.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-19T09:10:52-07:00","id":868474,"title":"","content":"Cool thanks. Nice use of embeds. <br /> <br /> What about demon form?<br /> <br /> Claws and fangs to simulate frenzy or partial transformation for protean?<br /> <br /> What else could work either for partial or full demon form?<br /> <br /> Oh and what about the Turn Blade embed? Doesn't that downgrade lethal to bashing?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1117,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1117-overload","user":"overload","date":". 04-19-2016, 12:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1117-overload","name":"overload","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1117_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-19T09:21:43-07:00","id":868482,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>overload</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/868386-supernatural-cover?p=868474#post868474\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Cool thanks. Nice use of embeds.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sure, no problem.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>overload</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/868386-supernatural-cover?p=868474#post868474\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What about demon form?</div> </div> </div> </div>Depends on the Form ability, how it looks, and how convincing an explanation the Demon can give. All Transformations provoke Compromise, though, so they should be kept to a minimum.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>overload</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/868386-supernatural-cover?p=868474#post868474\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Claws and fangs to simulate frenzy or partial transformation for protean?</div> </div> </div> </div>If they seem like they fit, or the Demon can argue away any oddities (unique Bloodlines, post-Embrace body modifications, etc.).<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>overload</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/868386-supernatural-cover?p=868474#post868474\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What else could work either for partial or full demon form?</div> </div> </div> </div>Eye based tells can be passed off as Nosferatu quirks (but make sure that's your story). Nanobot Composition can replicate some Protean. Wound Healing fits normally.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>overload</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/868386-supernatural-cover?p=868474#post868474\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh and what about the Turn Blade embed? Doesn't that downgrade lethal to bashing?</div> </div> </div> </div>That or negate a weapon's bonus damage. Comboing with Just Bruised makes a Demon hard to take down.<br /> <br /> Addictive Presence might be useful for simulating a Vinculum, if needed.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-19T09:40:41-07:00","id":868498,"title":"","content":"Ok next question. Vampiric weaknesses, any way to &quot;simulate&quot; them as part of your cover?<br /> <br /> Obviously some kindred can mask their beast so that one may be easily brushed off. <br /> <br /> But sun and fire.. just a high acting skill I suppose could get around the fear aspect. But if the sun happened to be shining on you without you realizing, like through a window... could be a giveaway.<br /> <br /> Perhaps taking it a step forward and not only are they impersonating a kindred but also infiltrating the dragons may help for general kindred. But then you add a layer of complexity with fooling a covenant. <br /> <br /> Thoughts on kindred banes?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1117-overload","name":"overload","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1117_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-19T09:55:10-07:00","id":868513,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>overload</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/868386-supernatural-cover?p=868498#post868498\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ok next question. Vampiric weaknesses, any way to &quot;simulate&quot; them as part of your cover?<br /> <br /> Obviously some kindred can mask their beast so that one may be easily brushed off.<br /> <br /> But sun and fire.. just a high acting skill I suppose could get around the fear aspect. But if the sun happened to be shining on you without you realizing, like through a window... could be a giveaway.<br /> <br /> Perhaps taking it a step forward and not only are they impersonating a kindred but also infiltrating the dragons may help for general kindred. But then you add a layer of complexity with fooling a covenant.<br /> <br /> Thoughts on kindred banes?</div> </div> </div> </div>I actually had a character that was infiltrating as a vampire. I ended up using Overlocked Gadgets, with the Drawback being simulating the vampire weakness in question (if they need to ditch the Bane, drop/deactivate the Gadget). Bends the rules a little, but keeps it in spirit, I think.<br /> <br /> You could also use things like Combustion, Incendiary, Trick of the Light, and yes, more lying, to fake the Banes.<br /> <br /> Play Possum might also be something to look into for faking Torpor or the Daysleep.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}